<view class="page"><view class="title">顾客与护理记录</view><view class="subtitle">仅到店、常用项目、余次与人工待联系提示。</view><input class="field" value="{{search}}" bindinput="search" placeholder="搜索姓名或演示编号"/><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载顾客…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{!ready&&!loading}}" class="empty">请先回待办页进入店长演示账户。</view><view wx:if="{{ready&&!filtered.length}}" class="empty">没有找到匹配顾客。</view><view wx:for="{{filtered}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="heading">{{item.customer.name}}</view><view>到店 {{item.visits}} 次 · 有效卡余 {{item.remaining}} 次</view><view class="muted">常用：{{item.usual}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.contact_hint}} · 本金 ¥{{item.balanceText}}</view><button class="secondary" data-url="/pages/customer-detail/index?id={{item.customer.id}}" bindtap="go">查看卡包与来源流水</button></view></view>
